usage: t44-brief-inputs.py [-h] --repo REPO --ref REF --es-repo ES_REPO
                           [--es-ref ES_REF] --out OUT

T44 immutable input binding. Reads Git objects; writes metadata, never
sources. Selector grammar independently reproduced by P1's retained derive.py.
This reader does not execute renovation-inventory, a recipe, or an accepted
test.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --ref REF
  --es-repo ES_REPO
  --es-ref ES_REF
  --out OUT
